  "description": "Yang-Hui, who had secretly loved Tae-Young since childhood. Following Tae-Young's father's dying wish to take good care of his son even if he wasn't around, he never even dreamed of confessing and distanced himself from Tae-Young to sort out his feelings. Just as his constant tension and avoidance during Tae-Young's military service began to ease... One day, he wakes up to find himself completely naked, sleeping next to Tae-Young...?!\n\n *“No, we can't do this...!”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
